# Paths an unattended change may never touch. One glob per line; `*` within a segment,
# `**` across segments. Rules starting with `**/` name a kind of file anywhere.

# Secrets and environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Schema: migrations are generated and serial
**/migrations/**

# CI, infrastructure, agent configuration
.github/**
.acme/**
.claude/**
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml

# Vendored code and lock files
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/**
**/package-lock.json
**/composer.lock
